Inspect pre-change impact over Eshu evidence

Usage:
  eshu change [command]

Available Commands:
  impact      Map a local diff or changed file list to bounded impact evidence
  plan        Build a read-only developer change plan over bounded impact evidence

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for change

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu change [command] --help" for more information about a command.
